    monitoring: "Monitor for signs of hypersensitivity, renal and hepatic function at baseline and during prolonged therapy, complete blood count for prolonged courses. Therapeutic drug monitoring required for aminoglycosides and vancomycin. FDA-specific monitoring data available in prescribing information.",
